			"updated": 1783427514383,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "1. Time: How long it takes to run (Instructions take time to execute).\n2. Storage Space: Where the data is stored (Which data structures are used?).\n   Note: We can always buy more storage space, but we can't always buy more time. \n   Therefore, Time Complexity is our primary focus.",
			"rawText": "1. Time: How long it takes to run (Instructions take time to execute).\n2. Storage Space: Where the data is stored (Which data structures are used?).\n   Note: We can always buy more storage space, but we can't always buy more time. \n   Therefore, Time Complexity is our primary focus.",
			"fontSize": 20,
