			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783430896500,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Option 2: The Methodological\n\nInstead of specific running times, we use mathematical techniques to estimate complexity\nbased on the algorithm's scalability.\n    - The Core Concept: Runtime is defined as a mathematical function of the input size, n.\n    - Primitive Operations: We estimate time by counting \"primitive operations\" (basic, low-\n      level actions independent of language/hardware).\n          - Examples: Declaration statements, arithmetic operations, assignments, evaluating\n            expressions, array indexing, method calls.\n          - Assumption: Each primitive operation takes some constant time, let's call it c.",
			"rawText": "Option 2: The Methodological\n\nInstead of specific running times, we use mathematical techniques to estimate complexity based on the algorithm's scalability.\n    - The Core Concept: Runtime is defined as a mathematical function of the input size, n.\n    - Primitive Operations: We estimate time by counting \"primitive operations\" (basic, low-\n      level actions independent of language/hardware).\n          - Examples: Declaration statements, arithmetic operations, assignments, evaluating\n            expressions, array indexing, method calls.\n          - Assumption: Each primitive operation takes some constant time, let's call it c.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "ykDjSNMz",
			"originalText": "Option 2: The Methodological\n\nInstead of specific running times, we use mathematical techniques to estimate complexity based on the algorithm's scalability.\n    - The Core Concept: Runtime is defined as a mathematical function of the input size, n.\n    - Primitive Operations: We estimate time by counting \"primitive operations\" (basic, low-\n      level actions independent of language/hardware).\n          - Examples: Declaration statements, arithmetic operations, assignments, evaluating\n            expressions, array indexing, method calls.\n          - Assumption: Each primitive operation takes some constant time, let's call it c.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
