			"text": "3. Selection (If-Else)\n    - Rule: Runtime of the condition + max between the if-block and else-block.\n\n\n\n\n\n    - Total Time: T(n) = c₁ + max(c₂, c₃) (Constant time)",
			"rawText": "3. Selection (If-Else)\n    - Rule: Runtime of the condition + max between the if-block and else-block.\n\n\n\n\n\n    - Total Time: T(n) = c₁ + max(c₂, c₃) (Constant time)",
