			"updated": 1783430910403,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "4. Basic Repetition (Single Loop)\n    - Rule: Runtime of loop statements x number of iterations.\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    - Total Time: T(n) = c₁ + c₂+ (n+1)c₃+ nc₄ + nc₅\n    - Growth Rate: T(n) is proportional to n.",
			"rawText": "4. Basic Repetition (Single Loop)\n    - Rule: Runtime of loop statements x number of iterations.\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    - Total Time: T(n) = c₁ + c₂+ (n+1)c₃+ nc₄ + nc₅\n    - Growth Rate: T(n) is proportional to n.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "ytmzucD6B02i3gAdQ6Sh4",
			"originalText": "4. Basic Repetition (Single Loop)\n    - Rule: Runtime of loop statements x number of iterations.\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    - Total Time: T(n) = c₁ + c₂+ (n+1)c₃+ nc₄ + nc₅\n    - Growth Rate: T(n) is proportional to n.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
