			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783431256972,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "4. Basic Repetition (Single Loop)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    - Total Time: T(n) = c₁ + (n+1)c₂ + nc₃ + n(n+1)c₄ + n²c₅+ n²c₆ + nc₇\n    - Growth Rate: T(n) is proportional to n².",
			"rawText": "4. Basic Repetition (Single Loop)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    - Total Time: T(n) = c₁ + (n+1)c₂ + nc₃ + n(n+1)c₄ + n²c₅+ n²c₆ + nc₇\n    - Growth Rate: T(n) is proportional to n².",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "w2W8rzAHLeh-QZXaiCY9P",
			"originalText": "4. Basic Repetition (Single Loop)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    - Total Time: T(n) = c₁ + (n+1)c₂ + nc₃ + n(n+1)c₄ + n²c₅+ n²c₆ + nc₇\n    - Growth Rate: T(n) is proportional to n².",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
