			"index": "b1B",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 367428936,
			"version": 180,
			"versionNonce": 776127800,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [
				{
					"id": "OMIq8y1E",
					"type": "arrow"
				}
			],
			"updated": 1783431960869,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Focus on the dominant term: Keep the fastest-growing term.\nDrop constants, coefficients, and lower-order terms: They do not affect the growth rate as n\nincreases.\n  - f(n) = 7n - 3 → O(n)\n  - f(n) = 8n² log n + 5n² + n → O(n² \\log n)\n  - f(n) = 3n² + 5n → O(n²)",
			"rawText": "Focus on the dominant term: Keep the fastest-growing term.\nDrop constants, coefficients, and lower-order terms: They do not affect the growth rate as n increases.\n  - f(n) = 7n - 3 → O(n)\n  - f(n) = 8n² log n + 5n² + n → O(n² \\log n)\n  - f(n) = 3n² + 5n → O(n²)",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Focus on the dominant term: Keep the fastest-growing term.\nDrop constants, coefficients, and lower-order terms: They do not affect the growth rate as n increases.\n  - f(n) = 7n - 3 → O(n)\n  - f(n) = 8n² log n + 5n² + n → O(n² \\log n)\n  - f(n) = 3n² + 5n → O(n²)",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
