			"seed": 1463705912,
			"version": 272,
			"versionNonce": 2087349801,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783437012307,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "B. Nested Loops — Quadratic Time O(n²)\nA nested repetition block requires multiplying the outer loop iterations by\nthe inner loop iterations. If both loops scale with $n$, the execution time\ngrows at a quadratic rate. ",
			"rawText": "B. Nested Loops — Quadratic Time O(n²)\nA nested repetition block requires multiplying the outer loop iterations by the inner loop iterations. If both loops scale with $n$, the execution time grows at a quadratic rate. ",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "BvfuTnbD",
			"originalText": "B. Nested Loops — Quadratic Time O(n²)\nA nested repetition block requires multiplying the outer loop iterations by the inner loop iterations. If both loops scale with $n$, the execution time grows at a quadratic rate. ",
